Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 17:53:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/14] Feature: Web IDE Phase 2 - Monaco Integration & Robust
 Protocol

- Integrated Monaco Editor for syntax highlighting and professional editing.
- Implemented dedicated 'save_file' WebSocket message type for reliable saving.
- Improved driver's 'sprintf' Efun to handle padded formats (%02d) gracefully.
- Fixed 'input_to' argument alignment to match MudOS standards.
- Added 'enable_wizard()' auto-activation for God/Wizard roles in user.c.
- Synchronized all frontend improvements across fs/ and fsmud/ libraries.
